@startuml
title Stop, discuss, amend, continue
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
participant "Listener" as L
participant "Page" as G
participant "Player" as P
participant "Session\n(coding agent)" as S
participant "Walk files" as F
L -> G : D + note
G -> P : discuss
P -> P : bookmark: walk, version,\nphrase, audio offset
P -> S : inbox record\n(ctl wait / MCP returns)
L <-> S : talk it over
S -> F : patch
S -> F : amend: next version\n+ change log line
S -> P : reload
P -> F : load, validate
P -> P : map the bookmark\n(rules a-e)
P -> G : reloaded: changed,\ninserted, deleted
L -> G : Continue
G -> P : play
P -> G : corrections first,\nthen the listener's place
@enduml
